  /* When the doorway is too short to hold the name, the promise, the film
     slot and Enter, the slot is what gives way: it is a placeholder until the
     film arrives, and the words are the offer. Decided by the door's own
     height — Safari's viewport excludes its toolbars, so a 932px phone reports
     745 and any viewport rule mis-sorts real phones. */
